Package: imurun
Title: Beginner-Friendly Command-Line Front-End for imuGAP
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(person("Carl", "Pearson", email = "carl.ab.pearson@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0701-7860")),
      person("Claire Perrin", "Smith", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1069-9460")),
      person("Weston", "Voglesonger", email = "westonvogle@gmail.com", role = "ctb"))
Description: A lean command-line front-end to the 'imuGAP' model-fitting
    package. Reads model inputs (observations, populations, and locations)
    from a directory of CSV or RDS files or from a single 'xlsx' workbook,
    validates them against the canonical 'imuGAP' schema, runs a fit, and
    writes the result out. The helper functions are exported so they can be
    used directly from R as well as from the bundled command-line script.
